Almost nothing takes "minimal coding" in nethack. What if:

1) You drag an object into a pit / hole?
2) You drag an object onto a polymorph trap?
3) A monster picks up the item you are dragging?
4) You teleport while dragging an object?
5) You drag an object out of a store?
6) You drag an object upstairs / downstairs?
7) A corpse rots away while you are dragging it?
8) etc.
9) etc.
10) etc.

Yes, the code exists for iron balls, but that code is very specialised
and can make assumptions about iron balls which will not apply to other
objects.

